          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.33,
            0.627,
            0.356
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "2.1 Experiencing the Power Play ..."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.381,
            0.441,
            0.403
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "An Impossible Venture!"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.412,
            0.847,
            0.452
          ],
          "content": "Take a sheet of paper, as large a sheet as you can find. Fold it once. Fold it again, and again."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.461,
            0.616,
            0.482
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "？ How many times can you fold it over and over?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.486,
            0.847,
            0.522
          ],
          "content": "Estu says “I heard that a sheet of paper can’t be folded more than 7 times”."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.523,
            0.847,
            0.559
          ],
          "content": "Roxie replies “What if we use a thinner paper, like a newspaper or a tissue paper?”"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.559,
            0.743,
            0.579
          ],
          "content": "Try it with different types of paper and see what happens."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.269,
            0.619,
            0.442,
            0.678
          ],
          "content": "If you can fold a paper 46 times, it will be so thick that it can reach the Moon!"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.521,
            0.61,
            0.668,
            0.683
          ],
          "content": "What! That’s crazy! Just 46 times!? You must have ignored several zeros after 46."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.586,
            0.832,
            0.794
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_0_image_13.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.81,
            0.847,
            0.849
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "？ Say you can fold a sheet of paper as many times as you wish. What would its thickness be after 30 folds? Make a guess."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.853,
            0.847,
            0.891
          ],
          "content": "Let us find out how thick a sheet of paper will be after 46 folds. Assume that the thickness of the sheet is 0.001 cm."
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "bbox": [
            0.448,
            0.971,
